+---
+name: yq
+owner: bgruening
+description: Portable command-line YAML, JSON, XML, CSV, TSV, TOML and properties processor
+categories:
+  - Text Manipulation
+homepage_url: https://github.com/mikefarah/yq
+remote_repository_url: https://github.com/bgruening/galaxytools/tree/master/tools/yq
+long_description: |
+  yq is a lightweight and portable command-line YAML, JSON, XML, CSV, TSV, TOML,
+  HCL, INI and properties processor that uses jq-like syntax. This wrapper exposes
+  the eval and eval-all commands, enabling querying, transforming and converting
+  structured data files within Galaxy workflows.
+type: unrestricted
